#: ../../solid/crystal_symmetry.rst:2
msgid "結晶の対称性"
msgstr "Crystal Symmetry"

#: ../../solid/crystal_symmetry.rst:4
msgid ""
"回転・鏡映・反転・並進を座標で表し、原子配置を保つ操作を調べます。 操作の線形部分を集めた\\ :ref:`点群<crystal-point-"
"group>`\\ と、並進まで含めた\\ :ref:`空間群<crystal-space-group>`\\ の関係を学びます。 "
"点群で移り合う結晶方向と格子面を、\\ :ref:`等価な方向と面の族<equivalent-directions>`\\ としてまとめます。"
msgstr ""
"We express rotations, reflections, inversions, and translations in "
"coordinates and examine which operations preserve the atomic arrangement."
" We study the relationship between the \\ :ref:`point group <crystal-"
"point-group>`\\ , which collects the linear parts of the operations, and "
"the \\ :ref:`space group <crystal-space-group>`\\ , which includes the "
"translations as well. We group crystal directions and lattice planes "
"related by point group operations into \\ :ref:`families of equivalent "
"directions and planes <equivalent-directions>`\\ ."

